[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:89. For Sale]
[00:00.840]Lesson 89. | 第89课。
[00:03.160]Good afternoon. | 午安。
[00:05.610]I believe that this house is for sale. | 我相信这栋房子要出售。
[00:08.240]That's right. | 是的。
[00:09.570]May I have a look at it, please? | 我可以看看吗？
[00:11.515]Yes, of course. Come in. | 是的，当然。请进。
[00:14.720]How long have you lived here? | 你在这里住了多久了？
[00:17.460]I have lived here for 20 years. | 我在这里住了20年了。
[00:20.425]20 years? | 20年了？
[00:22.160]That's a long time. | 那是很长一段时间。
[00:23.935]Yes, I have been here since 1947. | 是的，我从1947年就住在这里了。
[00:27.850]Then why do you want to sell it? | 那么你为什么要卖掉它呢？
[00:30.145]Because I have just retired. | 因为我刚退休。
[00:32.980]I want to buy a small house in the country. | 我想在乡下买一栋小房子。
[00:36.735]How much does this house cost? | 这栋房子多少钱？
[00:39.375]6,850 pounds. | 6850英镑。
[00:42.835]That's a lot of money. | 那是一大笔钱。
[00:44.520]It's worth every penny of it. | 它每一分钱都值得。
[00:47.140]Well, I like the house, | 嗯，我喜欢这房子，
[00:49.740]but I can't decide yet. | 但我还不能决定。
[00:51.895]My wife must see it first. | 我妻子必须先看看。
[00:54.255]Women always have the last word. | 女人总是有最终决定权。